                <head>[Form No. 42.]</head>
                <p rendition="#center">[Kingdom of Belgium, minister of agriculture and public
                    works. Service of public health and hygiene.]</p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">inspection of imported meats.</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#flush">No. —.</p>
                <p>Received of Mr. ________,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d98-f1"/> for the
                        inspection<anchor n="2" xml:id="d98-f2"/> of ________ kilograms of meat of
                    ________, the sum of ________,<anchor n="3" xml:id="d98-f3"/></p>
                <p>At ________, the ________, 189 ________</p>
                <p rendition="#right">The expert.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d98-f1" n="1" xml:id="d98-f1-content">
                <p>Name, profession, dwelling place of the importer.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d98-f2" n="2" xml:id="d98-f2-content">
                <p>In case of a second inspection, modify the text.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d98-f3" n="3" xml:id="d98-f3-content">
                <p>In full words.</p>
            </note>
